@Alessio71 No offense taken at all! You were absolutely right — the version was wrong, and your report helped us find and fix a real bug.

**Root cause:** The build system had a T4 template with hardcoded version `1.80.2` that was overwriting the correct version during compilation. This has been fixed in commit `7842324`.

**The nightly you downloaded (2026-03-20, f8914dc) was built BEFORE the fix.** A new nightly was just published today — please download it from [Releases](https://github.com/r...
